{"id":"3d408f890c399f45","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-completeness.md","title":"Completeness","display":"df-completeness — Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-completeness","aliases":["88-df-completeness"],"display":"df-completeness — Completeness","depends_on":["[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-logical-consequence]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completeness — Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b906e83ff9b25155\" href=\"?note=b906e83ff9b25155\" title=\"88-df-logical-consequence\">88-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\\)</span> (semantic-completeness predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\models_S\\varphi\\to T\\vdash_R\\varphi\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_R(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\models_S\\varphi\\to T\\vdash_R\\varphi\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>相对于固定前提集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的语义完备性。它不同于理论的句法完备性\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\,(T\\vdash_R\\varphi\\lor\nT\\vdash_R\\neg\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\,(T\\vdash_R\\varphi\\lor\nT\\vdash_R\\neg\\varphi)\\)</span>；二者不应共用同一个未说明的“complete”含义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex